<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink179-kilavi">
       kuṟiyiṭattuvantu puṇarntunīṅkun talaimakaṉait tōḻi etirppaṭṭu varaivukaṭāyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
          The confidante urging marriage, having encountered the hero who left after uniting [with the heroine], having come to the meeting place.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink179">
<l>nalkumati vāḻiyō naḷinīrc cērppa</l>
<l>valavaṉ ṟākkat tuṟaiyiṟāp piṟaḻu</l>
<l>miṉṉolit toṇṭi yaṟṟē</l>
<l>niṉṉala tillā vivaḷciṟu nutalē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Oh man of the coast with dense waters! Grant [yourself to me]!</l>
        <l>Without you, this girl’s small forhead does not exist.</l>
        <l>Such is sweet-sounding Toṇṭi, where shrimps on the ghat leap,</l>
        <l>As crabs attack [them].</l>
              </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
